{"2948130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Life of a Thug", "steam_appid": 2948130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948130/extras/7cd5b96aa9f64b7f6059bce062cc9936.poster.avif?t=1786775232\" width=780 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948130/extras/7cd5b96aa9f64b7f6059bce062cc9936.webm?t=1786775232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948130/extras/7cd5b96aa9f64b7f6059bce062cc9936.mp4?t=1786775232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IT ALL STARTS WITH YOUR FIRST CRIME. </h2>Navigate the dark, neon-lit streets of Corrupticut City, where vice and crime tango. Gangs, mob bosses, corrupt politicians, illicit deals… Crowded bars, shadowy kebab shops, and smoke-filled casinos. This game is for players who dare to pay the price for their choices. Are you ready?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948130/extras/e188130a04fc69f04ebe8de7d4298089.poster.avif?t=1786775232\" width=780 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948130/extras/e188130a04fc69f04ebe8de7d4298089.webm?t=1786775232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948130/extras/e188130a04fc69f04ebe8de7d4298089.mp4?t=1786775232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEARN THE ROPES OF LIFE ON THE STREETS. </h2>This is a crime simulation game where you go from a nobody on the streets to an underworld kingpin. Crush your enemies and earn respect.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948130/extras/75dc9299c6d62c894efc21d6fc105da9.poster.avif?t=1786775232\" width=780 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948130/extras/75dc9299c6d62c894efc21d6fc105da9.webm?t=1786775232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948130/extras/75dc9299c6d62c894efc21d6fc105da9.mp4?t=1786775232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GRADUATE IN ILLICIT SCIENCES. </h2>The crime bosses and methods that control Corrupticut City will force you into tough choices and moral dilemmas. Advance from petty crimes to large-scale mafia operations to climb the criminal hierarchy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948130/extras/0c55507ef2e6e12373a2b181786ff7f5.poster.avif?t=1786775232\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948130/extras/0c55507ef2e6e12373a2b181786ff7f5.webm?t=1786775232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948130/extras/0c55507ef2e6e12373a2b181786ff7f5.mp4?t=1786775232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HERE, YOU HAVE TO GO BIG! </h2>Danger lurks on every corner. Mugging people, making illegal deals to fulfill the city's darkest desires, robbing stores under the cover of night, living in the shadows, and supplying the city's illegal trade will fill your pockets with dirty money. But what about your reputation?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948130/extras/e218ce0b54ab88afc0acf67db3b81aea.poster.avif?t=1786775232\" width=780 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948130/extras/e218ce0b54ab88afc0acf67db3b81aea.webm?t=1786775232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948130/extras/e218ce0b54ab88afc0acf67db3b81aea.mp4?t=1786775232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The daily newspaper will guide you to profitable robbery targets, stock market shares, shops, or lucrative trade opportunities.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948130/extras/67264425ba6735f1511d7c752fd1684d.poster.avif?t=1786775232\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948130/extras/67264425ba6735f1511d7c752fd1684d.webm?t=1786775232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948130/extras/67264425ba6735f1511d7c752fd1684d.mp4?t=1786775232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><i>&quot;Trust me, you wouldn't want to get this close to real crime. But maybe you would, who knows?&quot;</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948130/extras/be915918df506d131be013f80c51b50b.poster.avif?t=1786775232\" width=780 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948130/extras/be915918df506d131be013f80c51b50b.webm?t=1786775232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948130/extras/be915918df506d131be013f80c51b50b.mp4?t=1786775232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragra